"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-jacoco_quarkus-jacoco-includes]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-jacoco_quarkus-jacoco-includes[`+++quarkus.jacoco.includes+++`]##\n"
